          </a>

          <hr class="hero-rule">
        

        <div class="hero-grid">
          
            <a href="/article/peoples-consultation-on-agroecology-climate-adaptation-concludes-in-jorhat" class="hero-grid-item">
              <div class="hero-grid-text">
                <h4>People’s consultation on agroecology, climate adaptation concludes in Jorhat</h4>
              </div>
              <img src="/uploads/articles/1790884048642-04e042dd-thumb.webp" alt="" width="139" height="130" loading="lazy">
            </a>
          
            <a href="/article/ustm-concludes-workshop-on-academic-writing-and-scholarly-publishing" class="hero-grid-item">
              <div class="hero-grid-text">
                <h4>USTM concludes workshop on academic writing and scholarly publishing</h4>
              </div>
